{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "modkit",
 "version": "0.5",
 "title": "modkit",
 "description": "The base for the newer mods; changes nothing on its own. Mods get: menu items and pages in Track Setup ([FUNC] + [TRACK]) and in CONFIG > Mods (the last CONFIG screen), named settings per sound, pattern or project saved with the project in its own place on the +Drive (also by Save Pattern to Project, and carried by Transfer's project backup), p-locks of those settings on steps, device settings in the file modkit-settings on the +Drive. CONFIG > Mods > Last Page: [FUNC] + [TRACK] reopens Track Setup where you left it",
 "category": "Framework",
 "author": "drumkilla",
 "license": "MIT",
 "target": {
  "device": "model-samples",
  "product": "Model:Samples",
  "os": "1.13",
  "syx_sha256": "e11859b68deb7e5e3fe86ab32581212093849c4be5d3950add011eac398a2ce8",
